      "id": "claim_5d2d53f53efd4a0cae7d756700ad698e",
      "statement": "Branch-name and title generation in `POST /api/tasks` are each wrapped in a separate Next.js `after(async () => { ... })` callback (route lines 94 and 158) so the new `tasks` row is returned to the client before the AI Gateway round-trip completes; both callbacks first check `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` and skip the SDK call when the key is absent.",
